   "widgets_values": [
    "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is a person, features newly generated.\n<Subject 2> is a person, features newly generated.\n\nsummary:\n[pure generation] A tender, intimate moment where <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> embrace in a warmly lit, lived-in interior. The video focuses on the physical contact and emotional warmth between the two individuals in a single, continuous shot.\n\nretention_analysis:\n\ndetailed_description:\nCinematic live-action. The scene is lit by a soft, warm amber light from a large window off-camera, creating a gentle falloff and catching the fine, downy hairs on the subjects' necks.\n[Shot 1] The camera is positioned at a medium-close distance, about 1.5 meters away, framing <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> from the waist up. The 1:1 aspect ratio tightly encapsulates their forms, with their shoulders nearly touching the side edges of the frame. <Subject 1>, wearing a soft, heathered grey cotton sweater with visible pilling and slight stretching at the elbows, reaches out to wrap their arms around <Subject 2>. <Subject 2> wears a faded navy flannel shirt, the fabric showing a soft, brushed texture and fine loose threads at the collar. As they embrace, <Subject 1> rests their chin on <Subject 2>'s shoulder, their cheek pressing against the flannel, causing the flesh to slightly indent and a soft flush of pink to spread across the cheekbone. The camera pushes in at slow speed. We see the fine pore texture on <Subject 1>\u2019s nose and the individual strands of hair that have escaped their hairstyle, catching the golden light. <Subject 2> closes their eyes, their eyelashes casting long, soft shadows, and their hands grip the back of <Subject 1>\u2019s sweater, the fabric bunching and wrinkling under the pressure of their fingers. A slight shiver runs through <Subject 1>'s shoulders as they squeeze tighter, their ribcage rising and falling with a deep, slow breath. The shot ends with them held in a steady, motionless embrace, the light shimmering on the stray flyaway hairs between them.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe soft rustle of cotton and flannel rubbing together as they embrace. The sound of a deep, slow intake of breath followed by a long, relaxed sigh. Faint, distant muffled sounds of a quiet neighborhood outside the window.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA solo acoustic guitar plays a slow, fingerpicked melody with a warm, resonant tone. The notes are sparse, allowing the natural decay of the strings to fill the space."
   ],
